# Rot Farm Mortipede {3}{B}'s "Whenever one or more creature cards leave your graveyard, this creature gets +1/+0 and gains menace and
# lifelink until end of turn." Bot1 casts the 3/4 Mortipede on turn 1 and then Faithless Looting, discarding its Memnite and
# Ornithopter. On turn 2 Bot2's Tormod's Crypt exiles Bot1's whole graveyard - the two creature cards and the Looting - which is one
# batch (CR 603.2c: "one or more"): the Mortipede is a 4/4 (not 5/4) with menace and lifelink, and its toughness is unchanged. On
# turn 3 the effect is gone (CR 514.2): a 3/4 with no keywords.

